save shrine_offering = "absolutely nothing"

I am the Memory Keeper.
I guard offerings for eternity.
My shrine currently holds: {shrine_offering}

- Offer a flower
    set shrine_offering = "a delicate flower"
    Your flower will remain in my shrine forever.

- Offer a coin
    set shrine_offering = "a golden coin"
    Your coin will remain in my shrine forever.

- Offer nothing
    Perhaps another time, traveler.

Feel free to return and see what is kept in the shrine.